  "principles": [
    "Initial creation exposes appearance and a small ordinary-clothing set only.",
    "All other validated LPC character assets remain available to gameplay systems.",
    "Missing animation coverage never substitutes an unrelated component or animation.",
    "Equipment overlays must resolve against the same body, direction, animation state, and frame as the character base.",
    "Gameplay inventory slots are stable semantic owners; renderer attachment anchors remain separate.",
    "Tools are selected from inventory or the hotbar and temporarily occupy hand slots while active."
  ],
